<div class="chapter_content content" id="7688425_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="history">The following is a chronological listing of legislation of the City of Albany adopted since the 2005 republication of the Code, indicating its inclusion in the Code or the reason for its exclusion. [Enabling legislation which is not general and permanent in nature is considered to be non-Code material (NCM).] The last legislation reviewed for the 2005 republication of the Code was Ord. No. 73.112.05, adopted 12-5-2005.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>


